  "body_html": "<h1>Approximate Solution</h1>\n<p>A pair $(s,v)\\in\\overline\\Gamma$ is an approximate solution if there exist\nprofiles $s^n$ and positive numbers $\\epsilon_n\\to 0$ such that:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>each $s^n$ is an $\\epsilon_n$-equilibrium;</li>\n<li>$(s^n,g(s^n))\\to(s,v)$.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>The profile $s$ is then called an approximate equilibrium.</p>",
